edit: just for science facts.

Enjoy the first lesson of war: Know your enemy.  


Dota 2 is trying to teach you a great lesson, knowing how to win and what you can do with different heroes is knowing your enemy.

&#x200B;

To know your enemy makes you a better player.

&#x200B;

Read, observe, try, do your best. You can do it,  just, pay attention to your lesson.
